TEXT -40 8 Left 2 ;Generator with autostart (simplest way to drive a synchronous generator)\nTurbine control is on from start! (default)\nAVR is starting measuring voltage at 3s and is on at 3.5s (default) \nt_sync=3s (Synchronizing time) set as parameter
TEXT 0 200 Left 2 ;Symbol sg_gt_auto (sgen_auto.lib)
TEXT -104 120 Left 2 ;M (turbine torque)\nand\nF1 (magnetic field)\ncan be unconnected
TEXT 168 224 Left 2 ;Kp set to a small value (P-part of controller smaller)\nbecause otherwise the exciter voltage has\nvoltage ripples
LINE Normal 288 192 224 224 2
